<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Caregiver Tools &amp; Guides &mdash; Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<meta name="description" content="Guides, worksheets, checklists and downloads made by Legacy for dementia caregivers.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'resources' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero py-56-64">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow text-sand-light"><a class="text-sand-light" href="resources.html">Resource Hub</a></p>
    <h1 class="hero-title-clamp">Caregiver Tools &amp; Guides</h1>
    <p class="lede">Practical things to print, fill in, and take with you — to appointments, to family conversations, to the days that are hard.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Search Caregiver Tools &amp; Guides</h2>
    </div>
    <input type="search" class="resource-search" id="resourceSearch" placeholder="Search guides, videos and checklists&hellip; (try 'respite' or 'communication')" aria-label="Search Caregiver Tools and Guides">
    <div class="filter-row" id="filterRow">
      <button class="filter-chip active" data-cat="all">All</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="dementia-education">Dementia Education</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="communication">Communication</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="care-skills">Care Skills</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="caregiver-wellness">Caregiver Wellness</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="planning-safety">Planning &amp; Safety</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="financial-legal">Financial &amp; Legal</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid" id="resourceGrid">
{%- for r in resources %}
      <div class="card resource-item" data-cat="{{ r.category }}">
        <span class="resource-tag">{{ r.category_label | e }}</span>
        <h3>{{ r.title | e }}</h3>
        <p>{{ r.description | e }}</p>
{%- if r.link == "#demo" %}
        <a class="more" href="#" data-action="demo-resource-link">{{ r.link_label | e }}</a>
{%- elif r.link == "#demo-grant" %}
        <a class="more" href="#" data-action="demo-grant-status">{{ r.link_label | e }}</a>
{%- else %}
        <a class="more" href="{{ r.link }}">{{ r.link_label | e }}</a>
{%- endif %}
      </div>
{%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="small muted mt-24 d-none" id="noResults">No resources match your search — try a different term.</p>

    <div class="section-head mt-48"><h2>Caregiver Wellness Toolkit</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-640">A curated kit of self-care practices, checklists and wellness tools built for
      dementia caregivers. Previously its own section on the Resource Hub; it lives here now, alongside the guides.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>

    <div class="section-head mt-48"><h2>Downloadable guides</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-640">Printable guides on caregiving topics &mdash; from first steps after a diagnosis
      to planning respite.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sand">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Looking for something else?</h2></div>
    <div class="card-grid mt-24">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <p>Plain answers to what caregivers ask us most.</p>
        <a class="more" href="faq.html">Read the FAQ &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Talk to us</h3>
        <p>If you cannot find what you need, ask. A person will get back to you.</p>
        <a class="more" href="request-support.html">Request support &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Looking for more support?</h2>
      <p>Explore Caregiver Sanctuary programs, including respite, caregiver support groups, wellness opportunities, community experiences, and more.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="programs.html" class="btn btn-coral">Explore Programs &amp; Support</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
